  notes: "Each material patch is 16 px wide so the player can watch them interact. Under Arrhenius rate gating: acid+iron at 310 K fires ~once every 20-40 ticks per pixel pair, transforming iron to rust + venting hydrogen. Water+lava (1473 K) fires near-instantly per the 1000 rate_per_s. Chlorine+ammonia is the violent reaction with FFAA88 flash. Player walking on lava takes 12 dpt damage; mercury 4 dpt; polluted_water 1 dpt; chlorine/ammonia 3 dpt. Standard ambient world earth. Validates session 12 MATERIAL_TABLE 27->55 expansion + violent_burst chem_flash renderer wiring + Arrhenius rate gating.",
